    "title": "Microneedling with PDRN, Collagen or Exosomes — Explained",
    "slug": "microneedling-pdrn-collagen-exosomes",
    "category": "Treatments",
    "focus_keyword": "microneedling with pdrn",
    "meta_title": "Microneedling: PDRN vs Collagen vs Exosomes Compared | KESHO",
    "meta_description": "Understand microneedling with PDRN, collagen, and exosomes. Which to choose for your skin, what each costs, and realistic results from a UK clinic.",
